# Development environment for this repository, read by the devbox router.
# See config/devbox-router/README.md.
#
# This repository holds no language-toolchain marker, so inference.tsv cannot
# resolve it. Without this file the router depends on a machine-local entry in
# repos.tsv. The declaration is committed so that every clone routes the same
# way.
#
# web-dev is the environment the repository is edited from. The agent-runner
# environment is the Sandcastle control plane and is not a development
# environment for this repository.
web-dev
